  "id": "industrial",
  "name": "Industrial",
  "description": "A Nocturne-era battle ensemble, every sound home-built. The kit is synthesized by tools/build_homebuilt_sfz.py: a gated overdriven kick, bit-crushed noise snares, ring-modulated metal, an anvil and a clank, a reverse cymbal, and risers and whooshes as one-shots on keys of their own. The bass is Tide, the ring-modulated saw buzz from the Long Time Way ensemble; the lead is Wire, the band ensemble's cutting saw lead. Keys are Toll, the synthesized tubular bell, with the formant chant a voice of their own. The pad is three drones addressed by voice: a detuned supersaw breathing through a slow filter, a low semitone cluster, and the chant.",
